        What Can a Screenshot Analyzer Detect?
      </h2>
      <p>
        A modern <strong>screenshot analyzer</strong> performs multi-layer inspection across visible content, text semantics, and image structure. You can use our dedicated tools to evaluate:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-sm pl-1">
