        <li><strong>Sensitive Personal Data (PII):</strong> Scan for phone numbers, emails, payment cards, and credentials using the <a href="/screenshot-privacy-checker" class="text-primary underline hover:text-primary-active">Privacy Scanner</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Fraud and Scam Indicators:</strong> Flag artificial urgency, legal threats, OTP requests, and prize claims with our <a href="/screenshot-scam-checker" class="text-primary underline hover:text-primary-active">Scam & Fraud Checker</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Web Links and Hostnames:</strong> Parse URLs, detect unencrypted HTTP, and inspect domain formats via the <a href="/suspicious-link-checker" class="text-primary underline hover:text-primary-active">Suspicious Link Checker</a>.</li>
